      "text": "° Optionally, using the OpenShift AI Dashboard have a look the Advanced Settings of the DSPA :\n\n    - See which type of Database external or internal associated with DSPA\n\n    - Look at the Pipeline Definition \n        ° Do you want to create K8s resources when compiling the pipeline\n\n    - Look at the Pipeline Caching ",
